\"notice\":\"SCIENTIFIC \\u2014 the scifi concept mint (measure for accuracy \\u2192 mint at scientific maximum). A self-contained ERC-20 (zero imports \\u2014 airgap/offline-compileable) whose FIXED scientific supply is the maximum representable value, 2^256-1, minted entirely to the bankon.eth OVERLORD at construction. 18 decimals (cypherpunk2048 18-decimal accuracy, wei parity). No mint function: the scientific maximum is reached at genesis \\u2014 supply cannot grow.   decimals = 18 ; totalSupply = type(uint256).max = 2^256-1 The contract is also the OVERLORD's treasury surface: it can RECEIVE funds (plain ETH lands via receive(); any ERC-20 can be transferred to it) and the funds are SENT FROM the contract only by the OVERLORD's hand (sendValue / sendToken) \\u2014 token balances and supply are never touched by it. The scifi domain: the nGn oscilloscope (engine/ngn/oscilloscope.js) measures sound for accuracy at 18 decimals and derives a uint256 voiceprint in this same domain. SCIENTIFIC is the OVERLORD's first deploy (OVERLORD v1.10a). Privilege is BONA FIDE; this is the unit of scientific accounting. (c) 2026 BANKON / PYTHAI \\u2014 MIT\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"Scientific.sol\":\"Scientific\"},\"evmVersion\":\"cancun\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"Scientific.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x4406bca5772699e290f90e156ba6b5d7a478e9860eb1db59bfb93ab5eb32d087\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://c4b66b470a89375b836cb996e8bc5b5fa7283ad5a88847ab32dbdca5438743d6\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmcZHdYW91uUKDGhpMKnsw3pKahB4QoJD9MATzPVFEqfBx\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.24+commit.e11b9ed9"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"overlord_","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[{"internalType":"address","name":"owner","type":"addr